Data sources and APIs used (rate limits and terms apply):
- Crossref: https://www.crossref.org/documentation/retrieve-metadata/rest-api/
- arXiv: https://info.arxiv.org/help/api/
- OpenAlex: https://docs.openalex.org/ (API key required from 2026-02-13)
- Semantic Scholar: https://www.semanticscholar.org/product/api
- DBLP: https://dblp.org/faq/

LLM (optional): Alibaba DashScope/Qwen. Use of LLM sends citation context and
abstract/metadata to the configured provider. Set DASHSCOPE_API_KEY only if
you enable check_relevance.

No telemetry by default (REFGUARD_TELEMETRY=false).
